`c
`!THE COLORADO MESH MESH CLIENT`!
========================================
`a

One desktop app for three mesh ecosystems:

  * Meshtastic
  * MeshCore
  * Reticulum

The Colorado Mesh Mesh Client is a cross-platform Electron app
for macOS, Linux, and Windows. Connect over BLE, USB serial,
or Wi-Fi/TCP and keep local message history in SQLite.

`!HIGHLIGHTS`!
........................................
  * Messaging across supported mesh protocols
  * Multi-language interface
  * MQTT connectivity
  * Routing diagnostics and topology tools
  * Local-first message history
  * Nomad Network browsing and page hosting

This very page is served by its built-in Reticulum
Nomad Network host.

`!OPEN SOURCE`!
........................................
Written primarily in TypeScript and released under the MIT
license. The project currently has 74 GitHub stars and 9 forks.

`_`[Project website`https://colorado-mesh.github.io/mesh-client/]`_`
